    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d490-a2">

                <pb facs="0715" n="705" sameAs="frus:frus1945v03/pg705"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Extract of Message From the Prime
                            Minister to Marshal Stalin, of
                        April</hi> 16<hi rendition="#small-caps">th</hi>
                </head>
                <p>With regard to warning, it should surely be signed by us three and also be
                    properly timed and I am telling Mr. Eden to clear the matter with Mr. Stettinius
                    and I hope Mr. Molotov in Washington.</p>
            </div>
